  "author": {"login": "alice"}, "authorAssociation": "NONE", "labels": [],
  "body": "`report --export` on a dataset with no rows throws a TypeError and writes no file. Expected an empty CSV with just the header row.\n\nReproduced on 1.4.2 and 1.5.0.",
  "comments": []},
